---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navigation from "../components/Navigation.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";

const GITHUB = "https://github.com/Aniket2812/superreality";
const APP = "https://13.204.9.91.sslip.io/call/demo";
const FEATURES = [
  ["01", "Answers while you are busy", "Every buyer gets an immediate, natural response while you are in a showing, driving, or away from your phone."],
  ["02", "Qualifies without a form", "wondering learns the buyer's location, timing, property needs, and financing through a real conversation."],
  ["03", "Moves the lead forward", "It recommends relevant listings, answers grounded questions, and turns serious interest into a booked showing."],
];
const FLOW = [
  ["Answer", "A warm voice responds when a buyer calls, even when the agent cannot."],
  ["Understand", "Natural questions uncover what the buyer actually needs and how soon they want to move."],
  ["Match", "The concierge searches the agent's real listings and explains why each home is relevant."],
  ["Continue", "Preferences carry into the next call, and the agent receives a clear summary and next step."],
];
const FAQ = [
  ["Will it sound robotic?", "No. The conversation is responsive and natural. The assistant listens, asks follow-up questions, and stays within the tone and boundaries set by the agent."],
  ["Can it make up a listing?", "No. Recommendations are grounded in the listings connected to the workspace, so buyers only hear about homes the agent can actually offer."],
  ["What happens when a buyer calls again?", "wondering recognizes the buyer and continues from saved preferences and previous conversations instead of making them repeat everything."],
  ["When does the human agent step in?", "The agent receives the buyer profile, call outcome, relevant matches, and showing details, making the handoff immediate and informed."],
];
---
<Layout>
  <Navigation />
  <main class="overflow-hidden">
    <section class="page-grid border-b border-line">
      <div class="mx-auto grid min-h-[calc(100svh-7rem)] max-w-7xl items-center gap-16 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr]">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">The AI buyer concierge for real estate</p>
          <h1 class="display mt-7 max-w-[11ch]">Turn missed calls into booked showings.</h1>
          <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-black/55">wondering answers every buyer inquiry, understands what they need, recommends the right homes, and keeps the conversation moving until the showing is on your calendar.</p>
          <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href={APP} class="btn-primary">Try the live concierge →</a><a href={GITHUB} class="btn-secondary">Explore the project</a></div>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-black/45"><span>Always available</span><span>Grounded in your listings</span><span>Remembers every buyer</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -inset-14 -z-10 rounded-full bg-accent/10 blur-3xl"></div>
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[1.8rem] border border-white/10 bg-ink text-white shadow-[0_45px_100px_-40px_rgba(31,23,18,.75)]">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-5 py-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm font-bold"><span class="grid size-7 place-items-center rounded-[9px] bg-accent text-xs">w</span>wondering buyer concierge</div><span class="rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] text-white/60">● Live call</span></div>
            <div class="grid gap-3 p-4 sm:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr] sm:p-5">
              <div class="rounded-[1.25rem] bg-white/[.06] p-5"><p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-white/35">Buyer conversation</p><div class="mt-8 flex items-end justify-between"><div><p class="text-sm text-white/65">Maya is speaking with</p><p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-.04em]">Jordan Lee</p></div><span class="grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent">◉</span></div><div class="mt-8 flex h-12 items-center gap-1" aria-hidden="true">{[14,28,42,21,36,48,24,32,16,43,28,37,18,31,45,23].map((height) => <span class="voice-bar" style={`height:${height}px`}></span>)}</div><div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs text-white/55"><span class="rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5">3+ beds</span><span class="rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5">West end</span><span class="rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5">Move-in ready</span></div></div>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex-1 rounded-[1.25rem] bg-accent p-5"><p class="text-xs text-white/70">Buyer status</p><p class="mt-12 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-.06em]">Qualified</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/70">Needs captured naturally.</p></div><div class="rounded-[1.25rem] bg-paper p-5 text-ink"><p class="text-xs font-bold">Showing booked ✓</p><p class="mt-8 text-sm font-semibold">22 Garden Lane</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-black/45">Tomorrow · 4:30 PM</p></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="problem" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl scroll-mt-28 px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:py-32">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2"><div><p class="eyebrow">The problem</p><h2 class="section-title mt-5 max-w-[12ch]">Buyer intent disappears into voicemail.</h2></div><p class="max-w-xl self-end text-lg leading-8 text-black/55">The best inquiries often arrive while agents are driving, showing homes, or helping another client. A slow response means repeated questions, lost context, and a buyer who moves on.</p></div>
      <div class="mt-16 grid border-y border-line lg:grid-cols-3">{FEATURES.map(([number,title,body]) => <article class="border-b border-line py-9 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r lg:px-8 lg:first:pl-0 lg:last:border-r-0"><div class="flex justify-between text-xs"><span class="text-accent">●</span><span class="text-black/40">{number}</span></div><h3 class="mt-16 max-w-[14ch] text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-.04em]">{title}</h3><p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-black/55">{body}</p></article>)}</div>
    </section>

    <section id="how" class="scroll-mt-28 bg-ink text-white"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-16 px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:py-32"><div><p class="eyebrow">One continuous conversation</p><h2 class="section-title mt-5">From first hello to confirmed showing.</h2><p class="mt-7 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/50">wondering handles the repetitive work without making the experience feel repetitive for the buyer.</p></div><div class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] bg-white/10 sm:grid-cols-2">{FLOW.map(([title,body],index)=><div class="bg-ink p-8"><span class="text-xs text-accent">0{index+1}</span><h3 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold">{title}</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/50">{body}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>

    <section id="memory" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl scroll-mt-28 px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:py-32"><div class="rounded-[2rem] bg-accent px-7 py-16 text-white sm:px-14 lg:px-20"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-white/70">Why memory matters</p><h2 class="mt-7 max-w-[15ch] text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.02] tracking-[-.055em] sm:text-6xl">Returning buyers never start over.</h2><div class="mt-10 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/20 bg-white/10 p-5"><h3 class="font-bold">Conversation continuity</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/70">The next call begins with saved needs, previous questions, and earlier recommendations.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/20 bg-white/10 p-5"><h3 class="font-bold">Better listing matches</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/70">The concierge understands what buyers mean, even when they describe needs in their own words.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/20 bg-white/10 p-5"><h3 class="font-bold">A complete agent handoff</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/70">Agents receive the context behind the lead, not just a name and number.</p></div></div><p class="mt-10 border-t border-white/20 pt-6 text-xs leading-5 text-white/65">Technical note: CockroachDB keeps buyer history, listing context, and semantic recall together as one reliable memory layer.</p></div></section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-24 sm:px-8"><div class="text-center"><p class="eyebrow">The useful details</p><h2 class="section-title mt-5">Questions, answered.</h2></div><div class="mt-12 border-t border-line">{FAQ.map(([question,answer])=><details class="group border-b border-line py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-bold">{question}<span class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full border border-line text-xl font-normal transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="max-w-2xl pt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-black/55">{answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>

    <section class="px-5 pb-5 sm:px-8"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col items-start justify-between gap-10 rounded-[2rem] bg-ink px-7 py-16 text-white sm:px-14 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:px-20"><div><p class="eyebrow">Hear it for yourself</p><h2 class="section-title mt-5 max-w-[13ch]">Give every buyer a helpful first conversation.</h2></div><a href={APP} class="btn-primary shrink-0">Try the live concierge →</a></div></section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
